    add();add('All models and source-only repair distributions are sealed before target evaluation. The complete N13 references agree between independent ordinary-queen enumeration plus literal leaper filtering and compiled literal-F enumeration. Every support equals the true graph, so filtering the complete true census is exhaustive. The frozen fallback requires independent forward and compiled reverse zero-F enumeration if any support fails true-graph inclusion; that fallback was not needed. Any positive-probability invalid zero-state outcome would have falsified safety rather than being discarded.');add();add('Capacity covers every one/two/three-clue key from the full true N13 universe, with zero exclusions. Every valid state contributes 377 clue subsets. This is a complete, previously examined finite target universe, not a new held-out search cohort or a claim about a population of rule families. These two families were fixed in advance. No GPU search was launched after the capacity ceiling became known.');add()
    add(f"The complete monitored experiment used **{s['aggregate_CPU_seconds']:.6f} aggregate CPU seconds**, **{s['aggregate_GPU_worker_seconds']:.6f} aggregate GPU-worker seconds** and **{s['wall_seconds']:.6f} wall seconds**, within the frozen 600 CPU /120 GPU-worker /900 wall-second envelope. The individual fit cap was 30 seconds; all eight fits finished their 4,000 updates in 1.343182–1.823757 seconds. GPU-worker cost includes imports, numerical gates, fitting, construction and serialization; CPU accounting includes all descendants, builds, source preparation, distributions and complete capacity evaluation. The separate publication audit took {s['audit']['elapsed_seconds']:.6f} wall seconds.");add();add('Both Loki GPUs ran independent four-fit queues. Twenty live samples record utilization and advancing update/loss counters; examples show 67–68% on GPU 0 and 83–85% on GPU 1 while updates advance through 1,000, 2,250 and 4,000. Idle GPUs afterward reflect completion of all eligible fitting and the absence of an authorized search stage. No duplicate runs were added for utilization.');add();add('The public-only audit replays all eight training and complement draws, reconstructs every literal count/exposure/line/group design, recomputes the final native margins and complete fitted transfer, verifies all numerical-gate receipts, reconstructs every paired source mask and concrete learner call, independently re-enumerates both complete source and target populations plus both zero-F supports, rebuilds every integer clue histogram and recomputes every exact probability and frozen decision.');add();add('[Frozen protocol](protocol.json), [new bank preparation and fitting](source.py), [pure repair](learner.py), [exact source distributions](source_outcomes.py), [complete evaluation](evaluate.py), [resource monitor](gate.py), [public-only verifier](verify_public.py), [tracked summary](../../../../results/research/loki/h3an/summary.json), [all eight comparisons](../../../../results/research/loki/h3an/reliability.csv), [live utilization and update counters](../../../../results/research/loki/h3an/live-utilization.json), [figure provenance](../../../../results/research/loki/h3an/plot-provenance.json).')
